<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NBS CAUTIONS TALKS STILL IN PROGRESS.</title>
<headline>NBS CAUTIONS TALKS STILL IN PROGRESS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NBS Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that, further to the cautionary announced on Oct 15, talks it had entered into were still in progress and, if successfully concluded, may effect its share price.</p>
<p>NBS urged shareholdes to exercise caution when dealing in its shares pending a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
